        "issue": "Second-pass audit removed the broad integrative diagnosis RIU to avoid overlap with the specific cause-area checks. Validate prompt coverage without requiring a proven final cause or an extra generic synthesis unit."
      }
    ],
    "TECH036": [
      {
        "riu_ids": [
          "RIU-01",
          "RIU-02"
        ],
        "issue": "Scope logic and data/parameter validation are separately assessable; do not mandate every WHERE/join/subquery example."
      },
      {
        "riu_ids": [
          "RIU-04"
        ],
        "issue": "A test-only or non-destructive review path meets the conditional safety requirement; no obligation to execute a live transaction or restore backup now."
      }
    ],
    "TECH066": [
      {
        "riu_ids": [
          "RIU-01",
          "RIU-03"
        ],
        "issue": "Physical compatibility and configured operating settings are distinct; do not assume any particular generation of RAM."
      },
      {
        "riu_ids": [
          "RIU-02"
        ],
